    ],
    "description": "Mineral and Gemstone Collection\nMixed Specimen Lot - Amethyst, Lapis Lazuli, and Tumbled Stones\nVariety of Raw and Polished Specimens\nThis comprehensive mineral and gemstone collection features a variety of raw and polished specimens suitable for collectors, educators, or hobbyists. The lot includes diverse geological materials ranging from a crystalline amethyst cluster to polished tumbled stones and individual specimen jars. No brand or maker's mark is present on the specimens or the storage containers, which are typical of hobbyist mineral sets.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nAmethyst Cluster\n- Raw crystalline specimen with deep purple hues and white quartz matrix.\n2.\nLapis Lazuli Specimen\n- Natural rough piece featuring characteristic royal blue with tan/gold mineral inclusions.\n3.\nGemstone Tray\n- 12-compartment plastic tray containing various faceted and tumbled stones including peridot-colored, blue, and purple specimens.\n4.\nSpecimen Jars\n- Five small round plastic containers holding Tiger's Eye, dark minerals, and clear tumbled quartz.\n5.\nFloating Display Frame\n- White 3D suspension frame containing a single small mineral specimen.\nCondition:\nGood pre-owned condition. The mineral specimens are natural items and show characteristic geological variations, inclusions, and textures. The amethyst cluster remains intact with well-defined points. The plastic storage cases and jars show light surface scratching and minor shelf wear consistent with handling but remain functional for organization.\nThank you for all of your support!",
    "score_reasons": [
